    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BE KING</h2><br>Inspired by reigns and many other games , this small adventure! will make you take the role of a King.<br>And as a king you must make the best decisions for your empire, and ensure it stands!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About this Game</h2><br>Be king is a decision taking game, and you can loose if you take the wrong decisions!<br>Taking and making the right decisions is what you need to ensure you keep increasing your empire in size, and in power!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Colorfull<br></li><li>20 decisions that repeats over and over again!<br></li><li>Choices-Matter <br></li><li>Strategical Management<br></li><li>Cozy and relaxing.<br></li><li>Being a king could be fun, who knows?</li></ul>",
